get green; each change is opt-in and leaves the default run identical:
- research/routing_spike/site_process.py: per-site routed judge runtime,
  receipts, SiteProcess._make_runtime (fa609166, 6fd8db9f)
- mycelic/collective/pushdown/gate.py, packs/loader.py: N1 weak-site
  corroboration, optional pushdown key (22cbd0ed)
- mycelic/collective/edge/records.py, edge/site.py, packs/loader.py: optional
  near-duplicate roots (7bbaad1d)
Evidence that the default path is unchanged: the plumbing run (fake lexical
judge over --routing, 5,247 HTTP judge calls) reproduces the clean baseline's
found set and decoys exactly at seed 0; only c7_guards differed, on this pin.
File count unchanged (142).

